    {
      "title": "Risk Factors",
      "excerpt": "RISK FACTORS You should consider carefully\nthe following risk factors, as well as the other information set forth in this proxy statement/prospectus, before making a decision on\nthe Business Combination. These risks could have a material adverse effect on the business, financial conditioning and results of operations\nof the Combined Company, and could adversely affect the trading price of the Combined Company\u2019s securities following the business\ncombination. Risks Related to SINGAUTO\u2019s Business\nand Industry References in this subsection\nto \u201cwe,\u201d \u201cour,\u201d \u201cus\u201d or \u201cour Company\u201d refer to (1)\u00a0SINGAUTO Inc, prior to the consummation\nof the Business Combination, and (2)\u00a0PubCo, after the consummation of Business Combination, unless otherwise specified. We have a limited operating history and\nface significant challenges in the\u00a0refrigerated\u00a0commercial electric vehicle (EV) industry for cold-chain lo",
      "status": "source_excerpt_not_model_conclusion"
    },
    {
      "title": "Dividend Policy",
      "excerpt": "Dividend Policy Following completion of\nthe Business Combination, the Combined Company\u2019s board of directors will consider whether or not to institute a dividend policy.\nIt is presently intended that the Combined Company retain its earnings for use in business operations and accordingly, we do not anticipate\nCombined Company\u2019s board of directors declaring any dividends in the foreseeable future. Field: Page; Sequence: 195; Value: 1 Field: Sequence; Type: Arabic; Name: PageNo 171 Field: /Sequence Table of Contents Field: /Page BPAC\u2019S DIRECTORS\nAND EXECUTIVE OFFICERS Current Directors and Executive Officers BPAC\u2019s directors and\nexecutive officers are as follows as of the Record Date: Name Age Position William\n    Rosenstadt 58 Chairman and Chief Executive Officer Kulwant\n    Sandher 64 Chief Financial Officer Yarona\n    Yieh 43 Independent Director Scott\n    Silverman 56 Independent Directo",
      "status": "source_excerpt_not_model_conclusion"
    }
  ],
